# MPRIS wizard
msgid "Add Music Player"
msgstr "Musik-Player hinzufügen"

msgid "Adding an MPRIS compatible player"
msgstr "MPRIS-kompatiblen Player hinzufügen"

msgid "New Media Player"
msgstr "Neuer Medien-Player"

msgid ""
"This wizard adds a MPRIS compatible media player\n"
"to the list of SqueezeBox controllable backends.\n"
"\n"
"MPRIS is the 'Media Player Remote Interfacing Specification'.\n"
"See <a href=\"https://specifications.freedesktop.org/mpris-spec/latest/\">here</a> for details.\n"
"\n"
"If your player does not support the MPRIS interfaces\n"
"by itself, it may have a plugin that does.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dieser Assistent fügt einen MPRIS-kompatiblen Medien-Player\n"
"zur Liste der steuerbaren SqueezeBox-Backends hinzu.\n"
"\n"
"MPRIS ist die 'Media Player Remote Interfacing Specification'.\n"
"Siehe <a href=\"https://specifications.freedesktop.org/mpris-spec/latest/\">hier</a> für Details.\n"
"\n"
"Falls Ihr Player die MPRIS-Schnittstellen nicht von sich aus unterstützt,\n"
"gibt es vielleicht ein Plugin dafür.\n"

msgid "label"
msgstr "Bezeichnung"

